WEBVTT

00:20.850 --> 00:26.820
If I was dreaming, how did I forget?

00:26.890 --> 00:30.660
It pulsed through me, frigid, shocked me

00:30.660 --> 00:32.300
Can I do, do?

00:32.960 --> 00:37.960
I want you next to me when I summon you

00:39.130 --> 00:42.970
Waiting close by, but you seem far off

00:42.970 --> 00:45.310
Na, na, na, knight

00:45.310 --> 00:48.480
The more beautiful the rose

00:48.480 --> 00:51.450
The more its thorns hurt

00:51.450 --> 00:54.720
Now that I'm strong

00:54.720 --> 00:59.720
My heart knows to protect that vow

01:00.720 --> 01:03.760
Let's meet in the dark of night

01:03.760 --> 01:06.830
Where you're waiting

01:06.830 --> 01:09.830
You'll worship the cruel Dark Queen

01:09.830 --> 01:13.000
Who's drunk with danger

01:13.000 --> 01:15.970
You shattered the glass sword

01:15.970 --> 01:18.940
You wielded without thinking

01:18.940 --> 01:21.880
Its shards glow in the night

01:21.880 --> 01:25.350
I lick your wounded fingers

01:50.770 --> 01:55.810
M..My crow's feet are getting worse!

01:56.480 --> 01:59.810
Hey, guys! Quit eating and get a move on!

01:59.820 --> 02:01.620
Come on!

02:06.860 --> 02:09.890
I've never met someone so greedy.

02:33.820 --> 02:37.260
Is this it? She's somewhere in this town?

02:42.360 --> 02:44.060
Beautiful Skin Lotion...

02:44.060 --> 02:45.090
Huga.

02:45.090 --> 02:46.730
Make your skin shimmer!

02:48.630 --> 02:52.300
Oh, Flan, are you interested in cosmetics?

02:52.300 --> 02:53.330
Huga.

02:53.340 --> 02:56.180
You don't need that, Flandre.

02:56.640 --> 02:58.540
Oh, but Mistress,

02:58.540 --> 03:03.210
all women want to look more beautiful.

03:03.210 --> 03:04.880
Is that so?

03:04.880 --> 03:09.880
Yes, also they want to look as young
as they possibly can.

03:10.950 --> 03:12.590
Huga.

03:16.120 --> 03:17.930
I'm taking off!

03:21.630 --> 03:23.970
I'm gonna be late again if I don't hurry.

03:25.800 --> 03:27.510
Princess Sherwood!

03:28.240 --> 03:30.050
Good morning!

03:30.440 --> 03:32.080
Huga.

03:32.710 --> 03:34.240
Wh..What?

03:34.240 --> 03:38.580
Don't you think I've become prettier lately?

03:38.580 --> 03:40.450
Huh? Prettier?

03:40.450 --> 03:44.750
Like, maybe my skin is shimmering, for example.

03:44.750 --> 03:46.750
Shimmering?

03:46.760 --> 03:48.830
Oh, really?

03:49.760 --> 03:53.040
Sorry, I'm gonna be late if I don't hurry.

03:55.830 --> 03:57.870
He didn't notice.

03:57.870 --> 04:02.540
I had to special-order that expensive lotion, too!

04:03.470 --> 04:05.820
I'm gonna be late!

04:06.170 --> 04:09.640
Go now! Hurry and find her!

04:12.480 --> 04:14.460
My favorite cosmetic product?

04:14.620 --> 04:16.120
That would be this.

04:16.550 --> 04:21.830
So, that is what you use to have such
beautiful skin each day.

04:22.860 --> 04:25.330
Where do they sell it?

04:25.330 --> 04:28.130
In the drugstore in town.

04:28.130 --> 04:30.630
Drugstore, huh?

04:30.630 --> 04:32.440
All right!

04:37.310 --> 04:40.290
This is taking forever! Can't you find her?

04:42.880 --> 04:45.110
What? You're hungry!

04:45.110 --> 04:47.680
Fool! All you think of is food!

04:47.680 --> 04:51.150
I'm not letting you eat until we accomplish
what we came here to do!

05:04.130 --> 05:06.310
Where did you run off to?!

05:08.370 --> 05:11.010
The teacher keeps scolding me for being late,

05:11.770 --> 05:14.340
and they give me a ton of homework.

05:15.110 --> 05:18.020
Oh, that smells great!

05:20.320 --> 05:22.020
I need to eat that.

05:22.020 --> 05:24.160
Okay, I'll buy enough for everyone!

05:24.350 --> 05:26.160
Okay, thank you.

05:27.990 --> 05:31.960
Lord knows what they'd say if they found out
I ate this without them.

05:32.430 --> 05:34.960
But just a little snack...

05:48.780 --> 05:51.380
Huh? Wasn't that...

05:52.210 --> 05:55.320
This should be interesting.

06:01.120 --> 06:02.930
I found it!

06:03.390 --> 06:05.500
It only took three stores.

06:06.730 --> 06:10.010
I finally found it!

06:13.870 --> 06:16.440
After I finally found that lotion!

06:18.070 --> 06:20.470
Francesca, after them!

06:20.480 --> 06:22.610
Make him pay me back for breaking that!

06:22.610 --> 06:24.250
Huga.

06:31.650 --> 06:34.790
Ah, this is pure bliss!

06:37.330 --> 06:39.490
Thanks for the food.

06:39.490 --> 06:42.340
Take them, we're having a drawing.

06:43.030 --> 06:45.200
Hmm? What do you mean?

06:45.200 --> 06:48.340
We're having a special sales drawing
in this shopping arcade.

06:48.340 --> 06:50.140
There are twenty tickets there.

06:50.140 --> 06:52.510
I can really take all of them?

06:52.510 --> 06:54.890
It's because you come here every day.

06:57.180 --> 07:00.180
All right, I know I'm gonna win!

07:00.180 --> 07:02.480
Huh? He was in costume.

07:02.480 --> 07:05.470
It must be an event for the sales drawing.

07:06.790 --> 07:09.830
Is Francesca going to the costume party too?

07:20.000 --> 07:21.640
Huga.

07:23.340 --> 07:25.880
Where on Earth did they go?

07:28.280 --> 07:30.810
What? A suspicious-looking man?

07:31.410 --> 07:36.410
Francesca chased after him but she lost
sight of him somewhere nearby.

07:37.620 --> 07:38.850
I know the one.

07:38.850 --> 07:41.160
Did he do something?

07:41.390 --> 07:46.360
He stole the takoyaki I bought on
my way home from school.

07:46.360 --> 07:47.360
Takoyaki?

07:47.360 --> 07:52.360
Hiro, do you often eat out by yourself,
without telling us?

07:53.470 --> 07:55.970
What? N..No!

07:55.970 --> 07:59.110
Takoyaki is supposed to be quite delicious, yes?

07:59.410 --> 08:02.180
It must be, for you to sneak it in
without telling us.

08:03.110 --> 08:05.850
Geez! Not you, too!

08:06.550 --> 08:08.450
It's not true!

08:08.450 --> 08:10.480
I bought enough for all of us.

08:10.490 --> 08:13.630
Four portions, I figured we could
all eat it together!

08:15.220 --> 08:18.160
I'm telling the truth, you gotta believe me!

08:18.160 --> 08:23.160
I finally found and bought my lotion,
and he smashed it to pieces!

08:23.260 --> 08:24.570
Lotion?

08:24.570 --> 08:26.570
You're starting to take care of your skin?

08:27.570 --> 08:30.110
A lady has to worry about her appearance!

08:31.070 --> 08:34.180
Anyway, please excuse me, Sister.

08:41.650 --> 08:46.620
My sister didn't notice the change
in my skin either.

08:51.160 --> 08:54.930
Oh, right, we're plum out of toilet paper.

08:54.930 --> 08:59.110
Here's hoping I win toilet paper with number six.

09:00.340 --> 09:04.940
Toilet paper with number six...
Toilet paper...

09:06.170 --> 09:09.380
A winner! Number three!

09:09.380 --> 09:11.310
Congratulations!

09:11.310 --> 09:13.850
Go ahead, you have more turns left.

09:13.850 --> 09:16.420
All right, I'll get it this time.

09:16.420 --> 09:19.830
Toilet paper with number six...

09:23.090 --> 09:26.860
Another winner! This time it's number two!

09:26.860 --> 09:28.500
What?

09:30.900 --> 09:33.300
You guys are useless!

09:33.300 --> 09:36.080
Why can't you find her?

09:38.370 --> 09:41.180
You! Where the hell did you go?

09:43.080 --> 09:46.250
What? The takoyaki was delicious?

09:47.420 --> 09:50.330
Fool! You're completely useless!

09:55.360 --> 09:57.690
What? You found her?

09:57.690 --> 10:00.990
I see, I see, good work!

10:01.000 --> 10:02.910
Then, let's get going.

10:16.240 --> 10:18.380
Sawawa was doing some son of lottery?

10:18.950 --> 10:20.590
Huga.

10:36.460 --> 10:40.740
It is you, I presume,
the princess of the Royal Family?

10:41.270 --> 10:43.270
That would be me, yes.

10:43.270 --> 10:48.270
Nice to meet you, I'm the witch who
lives in the Black Forest.

10:48.380 --> 10:52.980
The truth is I've spotted some
extra crow's feet lately.

10:52.980 --> 10:54.050
Crow's feet?

10:54.050 --> 10:59.050
Huh? Go somewhere else if you wanna
talk about crow's feet, not in here.

10:59.890 --> 11:05.030
Besides, it's too late to do anything
about your crow's feet!

11:06.330 --> 11:07.530
Shut up!

11:07.530 --> 11:09.630
Shut up! Shut up! Shut up!

11:09.630 --> 11:11.940
So, what do you need me for?

11:15.070 --> 11:20.070
We have a legend of sons in my village that if
you take a Royal Family princess's energy,

11:22.410 --> 11:24.720
you'll be given eternal youth.

11:26.210 --> 11:29.620
So, in order to receive eternal youth,

11:29.620 --> 11:33.360
I've transcended time and space,
and come to this town.

11:33.890 --> 11:36.870
What? You're with those vampires?

11:37.090 --> 11:39.230
Vampires?

11:40.930 --> 11:43.700
Shut up! Shut up! Shut up!

11:43.700 --> 11:46.000
Don't group me in with the vampires!

11:46.000 --> 11:47.980
Pretty harsh words, don't you think?

11:48.670 --> 11:50.170
Reiri!

11:50.170 --> 11:54.380
Human blood is the same,
whether you drink it or suck it.

11:54.840 --> 11:57.510
Shut up! Shut up! Shut up!

11:57.510 --> 12:00.820
This is what I use! My magic mirror!

12:03.020 --> 12:06.690
If I stand before you and chant a spell,

12:06.690 --> 12:10.020
you'll be sucked into this mirror, like magic,

12:10.020 --> 12:13.130
and turn into energy while inside of it.

12:13.130 --> 12:15.940
That energy will grant me eternal youth.

12:20.270 --> 12:21.910
All right!

12:22.370 --> 12:23.800
The takoyaki thief!

12:23.810 --> 12:28.810
The youthful, beautiful energy of the princess
will be incredibly delicious!

12:29.580 --> 12:32.290
Prepare yourself!

12:49.800 --> 12:53.400
This isn't a game! She's not dying
to cure an old hag's wrinkles!

12:57.710 --> 13:00.470
Shut up! Shut up! Shut up!

13:00.480 --> 13:02.310
You can say that all you want!

13:02.310 --> 13:04.690
10,000 times or even a million times!

13:05.980 --> 13:09.720
That's it! Get her!

13:10.890 --> 13:13.190
Sorry to keep you waiting.

13:13.190 --> 13:15.500
I fried up some dumplings.

13:16.290 --> 13:17.930
Huh?

13:18.130 --> 13:19.630
Sis...

13:19.630 --> 13:22.600
What's this? You have company?

13:22.600 --> 13:25.810
Splendid! Would you like to eat with us?

13:26.670 --> 13:30.000
I won on number three in a drawing
in the shopping arcade,

13:30.000 --> 13:33.280
so I won thirty portions' worth of dumplings

13:35.140 --> 13:37.310
What is that?!

13:37.310 --> 13:39.520
It reeks!

13:40.110 --> 13:44.720
Eat up, everybody, I know you're hungry.

13:44.720 --> 13:46.700
I'm going to go fry up some more.

13:51.990 --> 13:56.130
It stinks! It stinks! It smells awful!

13:56.130 --> 13:59.240
Dumplings? She can't be serious!

14:02.640 --> 14:05.910
That's it, I can't take it any more!

14:05.910 --> 14:07.890
Retreat, retreat!

14:10.580 --> 14:14.690
Huh? I didn't know witches
can't handle dumplings.

14:15.320 --> 14:17.960
Anyway, let's eat 'em while they're hot!

14:18.550 --> 14:21.290
I don't think I'll enjoy them.

14:21.290 --> 14:25.400
That witch is heading towards
Princess Sherwood's mansion

14:30.500 --> 14:33.950
Hiro, Sawawa, Sister, just you watch.

14:34.700 --> 14:41.240
You'll be shocked at how shiny and
smooth my skin becomes.

14:48.580 --> 14:51.150
Where is she,
the princess from the Royal Family?

14:51.150 --> 14:53.100
Where is Princess Sherwood?

14:54.920 --> 14:57.060
I'm Sherwood.

14:57.060 --> 15:01.600
Princess Sherwood, I've come
to take your energy.

15:01.600 --> 15:03.470
What? An assassin?

15:04.030 --> 15:09.030
A beautiful young child like yourself
wouldn't understand my beauty.

15:09.500 --> 15:13.510
I'll be taking your energy for
the sake of my beauty!

15:13.510 --> 15:16.540
Beautiful? Me?

15:16.540 --> 15:17.540
Huga.

15:17.550 --> 15:19.350
Prepare yourself!

15:21.620 --> 15:23.930
Get her!

15:24.950 --> 15:28.200
I'm beautiful!

15:37.070 --> 15:40.440
Now, prepare yourself.

15:41.570 --> 15:44.370
Come forth, my magic mirror

15:44.370 --> 15:47.340
Grant my wish.

15:47.340 --> 15:52.310
Grant me eternal youth from this
princess of the Royal Family!

16:08.430 --> 16:10.070
Now!

16:15.440 --> 16:17.580
Are you all right, Princess Sherwood?

16:20.240 --> 16:24.350
Damn, and I was so close, too.

16:25.950 --> 16:28.880
Your beautiful older sister's
is better after all!

16:28.880 --> 16:31.890
More delicious by a factor of ten, no hundreds!

16:34.290 --> 16:36.600
Here I come!

16:53.610 --> 16:55.180
Sorry for the wait.

16:55.180 --> 16:57.780
I fried up more dumplings.

16:58.350 --> 17:02.160
Oh, Hiro, don't sleep there, wake up.

17:03.650 --> 17:05.790
Where did everyone go?

17:10.320 --> 17:11.530
That's it!

17:11.530 --> 17:13.510
I'm taking the dumplings with me!

17:15.930 --> 17:17.330
Liza!

17:17.330 --> 17:21.780
Damn, her wind blast is really powerful.

17:36.750 --> 17:39.250
It stinks, stinks!

17:39.250 --> 17:41.590
Hime, eat these now.

17:41.590 --> 17:44.260
She absolutely won't attack you
if you eat dumplings.

17:44.260 --> 17:45.900
Hiro...

17:46.130 --> 17:48.660
I don't think I'll like them much,

17:50.260 --> 17:51.740
but I'll do it.

17:55.640 --> 17:58.840
If she eats all those, I can't get near her!

17:58.840 --> 18:00.650
In that case...

18:02.640 --> 18:04.810
Hiro, give me dumplings, too!

18:04.810 --> 18:06.410
Princess Sherwood!

18:06.410 --> 18:08.390
Here, hurry and eat!

18:14.820 --> 18:16.800
Go, you two!

18:17.390 --> 18:18.490
Damn you!

18:18.490 --> 18:20.470
Huga!

18:39.650 --> 18:42.250
Ah! Where's Princess Sherwood?

18:42.250 --> 18:45.020
Damn, where did they go?

18:45.020 --> 18:46.850
This is bad.

18:46.850 --> 18:50.290
She's casting the spell on
Princess Sherwood over there

18:50.290 --> 18:51.930
What?!

19:02.170 --> 19:04.270
Princess Sherwood!

19:07.170 --> 19:08.880
Huga!

19:15.780 --> 19:23.130
Ah, the blood of the princess of the sacred Royal
Family has been tainted with the blood of a beast.

19:50.320 --> 19:54.420
My magic mirror... My mirror...

19:54.420 --> 19:59.460
See, he'd go to such lengths in order
to serve his royal master.

20:00.230 --> 20:03.900
Who would have thought it would
end without violence.

20:09.940 --> 20:12.510
Take these and go the hell home.

20:12.510 --> 20:14.110
Huh?

20:14.110 --> 20:18.040
Sawawa won this lotion by drawing number two.

20:18.050 --> 20:19.550
There's five dozen tubes.

20:19.550 --> 20:21.010
Lotion?

20:21.020 --> 20:23.330
I use it regularly, too.

20:24.320 --> 20:29.320
Y..You're letting me go without
any son of punishment,

20:30.060 --> 20:31.900
and even giving this to me?

20:33.290 --> 20:38.100
All women wish to remain beautiful forever.

20:38.100 --> 20:41.130
It's not like I don't understand where
you're coming from.

20:41.140 --> 20:45.480
However, you should apologize to Sherwood.

20:46.210 --> 20:47.880
Princess...

20:51.510 --> 20:54.350
This makes up for what your servant broke.

20:54.350 --> 20:56.260
I'm taking this.

21:00.620 --> 21:03.720
I apologize for the trouble I've caused you all.

21:03.720 --> 21:05.700
I'll be going now.

21:08.960 --> 21:10.770
Come, guys!

21:17.770 --> 21:22.310
I didn't know that you used that lotion too.

21:22.310 --> 21:24.210
I don't.

21:24.210 --> 21:25.210
Huh?

21:25.210 --> 21:26.750
But you said...

21:26.750 --> 21:29.060
It's because I'm merciful.

21:30.420 --> 21:32.390
Staying out late isn't good for your skin.

21:32.390 --> 21:33.720
Let's go home.

21:33.720 --> 21:36.290
All right, let's get to bed.

21:36.290 --> 21:38.220
Oh, housebroken finally?

21:38.230 --> 21:39.230
What did you say?!

21:39.230 --> 21:43.230
Well, maybe I'll go for a late night stroll.

21:43.230 --> 21:46.210
The night treats my skin better than the day.

21:47.740 --> 21:50.610
Damn that bitch!

21:53.870 --> 21:57.580
So, what do you think, Hiro?

21:57.580 --> 21:58.580
About what?

21:58.580 --> 21:59.650
Francesca!

21:59.650 --> 22:01.180
Huga.

22:01.180 --> 22:02.650
Huh?

22:03.920 --> 22:06.830
Why?!

22:07.560 --> 22:08.760
That fool.

22:13.060 --> 22:18.060
Get down on your knees and lick my red nails

22:18.630 --> 22:26.570
Call me queen with your entangled tongue

22:29.140 --> 22:31.910
The sun that blooms in Hell

22:31.910 --> 22:34.650
Darkness that's fallen to Paradise

22:34.650 --> 22:37.220
If you're confronted with light and despair

22:37.220 --> 22:39.850
Which one goes deeper?

22:39.850 --> 22:42.590
Roses fly from my head

22:42.590 --> 22:45.290
I'll scatter them into Nirvana

22:45.290 --> 22:47.890
Wounds that secretly pain you

22:47.900 --> 22:50.470
Blood that gushes away

22:50.530 --> 22:53.170
They both lead to the depths of my heart

22:53.170 --> 22:55.840
You've given these gorgeous gifts as tribute

22:55.840 --> 22:58.510
And yet you're still

22:58.510 --> 23:01.210
Seeking love?

23:01.210 --> 23:03.940
Tell me exactly to what extent

23:03.940 --> 23:06.610
Grown men are just foolish little boys?

23:06.610 --> 23:11.610
Get down on your knees and lick my sacred feet

23:11.890 --> 23:16.890
Call me queen in your hoarse voice

23:17.320 --> 23:22.320
The proof of your life creeps up the tower of pain

23:22.560 --> 23:25.270
Slowly making your way, you can barely breathe

23:25.270 --> 23:27.900
But if you still ask for it

23:27.900 --> 23:31.870
Your dying breath just might be

23:31.870 --> 23:40.160
The words that melt my frozen tears

23:41.480 --> 23:42.580
Huga.

23:42.580 --> 23:45.020
Flandre, do you know who William Tell was?

23:45.020 --> 23:46.020
Huga?

23:46.020 --> 23:48.120
He's a character from a legend from Switzerland.

23:48.120 --> 23:53.120
He's famous for shooting an apple
off his son's head with an arrow.

23:53.590 --> 23:57.130
Huh? Why are you putting an
apple on my head, Hime?

23:57.130 --> 23:58.910
To shoot it off, of course.

23:59.800 --> 24:03.240
Shh, you threw off my aim.

24:03.240 --> 24:06.650
Since Hiro can't speak now, I'll deliver it this time.

24:06.870 --> 24:07.870
Next episode, "Princess Hunter"

24:09.080 --> 24:10.780
Huga, huga.
